OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FGenerally
OL,6,Fcloudy through the evening and
OL,7,Fovernight. Dry for most areas
OL,8,Finitially but with patchy rain and
OL,9,Fmist developing later, particularly
OL,10,Ftowards dawn. Light winds. Cool,
OL,11,Fespecially in rural areas.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSaturday:FA rather grey day. Cloudy
OL,14,Fmorning with mist and patchy light
OL,15,Frain. The rain becomes more widespread
OL,16,Fthrough the day, easing overnight.
OL,17,FTemperatures around normal, with winds
OL,18,Fremaining light.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
