OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FHigh
OL,6,Fpressure remains dominant. Cloudy with
OL,7,Flight rain Sunday. Brighter and drier
OL,8,FMonday, once morning fog clears.
OL,9,FCloudy periods but mostly dry Tuesday.
OL,10,FLight winds, with temperatures around
OL,11,Fnormal.
